---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 内容更新规范
description: 知识、面经和代码示例的目录、Markdown 与提交约定。
pageKind: contribute
permalink: contribute/index.html
---

{% if catalog.contribution %}
  <div class="guide-shell">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="面包屑">
        <a href="{{ '/' | withBase }}">首页</a>
        <i data-lucide="chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>更新规范</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="guide-title-row">
        <span class="guide-icon">
          <i data-lucide="notebook-tabs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </span>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Content contribution guide</p>
          <h1>内容更新规范</h1>
          <p>{{ catalog.contribution.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="guide-quickstart" aria-labelledby="quickstart-title">
      <div class="guide-quickstart-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Quick start</p>
          <h2 id="quickstart-title">三步完成一次内容更新</h2>
        </div>
        <span>目录即配置，无需修改网站代码</span>
      </div>

      <ol class="guide-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="guide-step-icon">
            <i data-lucide="folder-tree" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </span>
          <span class="guide-step-copy">
            <small>01 · 选择位置</small>
            <strong>确定内容类型</strong>
            <span>先选岗位赛道，再选内容模块，例如 <code>program/knowledge/</code>、<code>planning/interviews/</code> 或 <code>program/code/</code>。</span>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="guide-step-icon">
            <i data-lucide="file-plus-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </span>
          <span class="guide-step-copy">
            <small>02 · 编写内容</small>
            <strong>添加 README 与 Markdown</strong>
            <span>一级标题负责展示名称，数字文件名前缀负责默认阅读顺序。</span>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="guide-step-icon">
            <i data-lucide="git-pull-request-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </span>
          <span class="guide-step-copy">
            <small>03 · 提交审核</small>
            <strong>使用范围明确的提交信息</strong>
            <span>按 <code>&lt;范围&gt;: &lt;摘要&gt;</code> 提交，通过 Pull Request 完成检查与审核。</span>
          </span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <div class="guide-layout">
      <article class="prose guide-prose">
        <p class="guide-section-label">完整规范</p>
        {{ catalog.contribution.body | renderMarkdown(catalog.contribution.sourceRelative) | safe }}
      </article>

      <aside class="guide-aside" aria-label="规范导航">
        <p>快速跳转</p>
        <ol>
          {% for heading in catalog.contribution.headings %}
            <li class="toc-level-{{ heading.level }}">
              <a href="#{{ heading.id }}">{{ heading.text }}</a>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
        <a
          class="secondary-button guide-source-link"
          href="{{ site.repositoryUrl }}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          <i data-lucide="square-arrow-out-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          查看规范源文件
        </a>
        <a class="primary-button guide-join-link" href="{{ site.joinUrl }}">
          <i data-lucide="user-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          加入共建组织
        </a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
{% else %}
  <section class="not-found">
    <span>!</span>
    <h1>更新规范暂不可用</h1>
    <p>内容仓库中缺少 `CONTRIBUTING.md`。</p>
  </section>
{% endif %}
